                logic: [{ type: "text", content: "本文: \"We fight together on sodden battlefields... The test of this conference is whether we can walk together, solve our economic problems, down the road to peace\"" }, { type: "text", content: "【ポイント】戦争では共に戦っているが、経済問題でも共に歩めるかが試金石。" }, { type: "arrow", content: "↓" }, { type: "text", content: "選択肢4: \"there were doubts about whether such cooperation would continue in economic fields\"" }, { type: "conclusion", content: "正解: 4" }]
