                            structureHtml: "<span class='chunk S-group'><span class='text'>Moore</span><span class='tag'>S</span></span> <span class='chunk V-group'><span class='text'>intended</span><span class='tag'>V</span></span>... but <span class='chunk S-group'><span class='text'>it</span><span class='tag'>S</span></span> <span class='chunk V-group'><span class='text'>became</span><span class='tag'>V</span></span> <span class='chunk C-group'><span class='text'>the driving force</span><span class='tag'>C</span></span>.",
                            translationHtml: "<span class='t-S'>ムーアは</span> <span class='t-V'>意図しました</span>...しかし<span class='t-S'>それは</span> <span class='t-V'>なりました</span> <span class='t-C'>原動力に</span>。",
                            naturalTranslation: "ムーアは当初これをコンピュータ技術の予測のつもりで述べましたが、それは結果として、その後の急速な技術進歩の原動力となりました。",
